		<senderName>Bao Meilan</senderName>
		<headline>The meteorological observatory of huolingole City, Tongliao City, Inner Mongolia issued a yellow rainstorm warning [level III / heavy]</headline>
		<description>At 03:30 on July 26, 2021, the meteorological observatory of horingol City, Tongliao City, Inner Mongolia issued a yellow rainstorm warning signal: the precipitation in the urban area of horingol has reached 44.5mm, and the rainfall will continue in the next 6 hours. Relevant units and personnel shall be prepared for prevention.</description>
		<instruction>1. The government and relevant departments shall do a good job in preventing rainstorm according to their responsibilities;</instruction>
		<area>
			<areaDesc>Huolingol Shi</areaDesc>
			<geocode>
				<valueName>CPEAS Geographic Code</valueName>
				<value>150581000000</value>
			</geocode>
		</area>
	</info>
	<info>
		<language>zh-CN</language>
		<category>Met</category>
		<event>暴雨</event>
		<urgency>Unknown</urgency>
		<severity>Moderate</severity>
		<certainty>Unknown</certainty>
		<senderName>包梅兰</senderName>
		<headline>内蒙古通辽市霍林郭勒市气象台发布暴雨黄色预警[III级/较重]</headline>
		<description>内蒙古通辽市霍林郭勒市气象台2021年07月26日03时30分发布暴雨黄色预警信号：霍林郭勒市区降水量已达44.5mm，且未来6小时降雨仍将持续。请有关单位和人员做好防范准备。</description>
		<instruction>1.政府及相关部门按照职责做好防暴雨工作； 2.交通管理部门应当根据路况在强降雨路段采取交通管制措施，在积水路段实行交通引导； 3.切断低洼地带有危险的室外电源，暂停在空旷地方的户外作业，转移危险地带人员和危房居民到安全场所避雨； 4.检查城市、农田、鱼塘排水系统，采取必要的排涝措施。</instruction>
		<area>
			<areaDesc>霍林郭勒市</areaDesc>
			<geocode>
				<valueName>CPEAS Geographic Code</valueName>
				<value>150581000000</value>
			</geocode>
		</area>
	</info>
</alert>
